# API contracts

Canonical spec: `docs/api.md`. Prefix `/api/v1`. Errors `{ "detail": "..." }`.

- Pydantic v2 for every request/response. No ad-hoc dict contracts.
- Auth on all `/api/v1/*` except login/register/google, `GET/POST /auth/sso/{slug}/*`, and the Stripe webhook. Identity from cookies (`dw_*`) only — ignore `Authorization: Bearer`. Never from body `user_id` / `access_roles` / `org_id` / `organization_id`.
- Resource ids are UUID strings, including chat citations `doc_id`.
- Upload returns `201` + `pending` and enqueues Celery. Do not extract PDF text in the handler; `page_count` may reserve quota. Org page quota exceeded → `402` (not `429`, not `404`).
- Chat token quota exhausted → SSE `type: error` **before** retrieval (same sense as `402`). Per-minute chat limit stays `429`.
- Feature not in plan (SSO / custom domain) → `403`. Dev billing simulate for another org → `404`.
- `GET /documents` includes `last_error` (null unless failed). `GET /documents/{id}/status` includes `stage` (`parse` | `chunk` | `embed` | null).
- `GET /documents` and `/raw` apply the same org + ACL as search. Missing-or-forbidden (including another org) → `404`, not a leaky `403` with the title.
- Delete is cascade: Postgres (document + chunks) + MinIO, scoped to the current org.
- `PATCH /documents/{id}` (org-admin or manager): `{ "access_roles": [...] }` updates the document **and** every chunk row. Do not re-embed. Do not accept `organization_id` in the body.

## SSE `POST /api/v1/chat/stream`

ChainWise envelopes (not named `event:` from the draft TZ):

```
data: {"type":"citations","citations":[{"doc_id":"<uuid>","doc_title":"Travel.pdf","page":4,"snippet":"..."}]}

data: {"type":"token","content":"..."}

data: {"type":"meta","tokens_used":640}

data: [DONE]
```

Citations first, then tokens. On failure: `{"type":"error","content":"..."}` — no stack, no foreign document titles.

Inspect is org-admin only (`ENABLE_SEARCH_INSPECT`; off by default in production). Same org + ACL filter as chat. Audit stores chunk UUIDs, never restricted chunk text. After M5, register/invites/switch-org follow `docs/api.md` § Организации. After M6, billing/SSO/domain follow `docs/api.md` and `docs/billing.md` (`BILLING_PROVIDER=dev` in Compose).
